WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
Here's something to think about.

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.280
The challenge isn't just getting

3
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.359
your teammates across the bridge.

4
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:07.279
It's getting the signal beacon back

5
00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:09.360
when someone needs to return.

6
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.093
Every trip costs time, including the return trips.

7
00:00:13.093 --> 00:00:15.080
Which teammate might be best suited to help

8
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.680
the group move back and forth efficiently?

9
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.680
Think about everyone's strengths before

10
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.924
making your next move.
